<title>PAKISTAN: Pak Suzuki Motor again in black.</title>
<headline>Pak Suzuki Motor again in black.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		 7,904 vs 5,703</p>
<p>    Profit before tax   743 vs    22</p>
<p>    Profit after tax    574 vs     5 million loss</p>
<p>    Dividend	    7 pct vs   nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Pak Suzuki Motor Company Ltd said it had wiped out accumulated losses of 534 million rupees and announced the dividend out of profits. Book closure November 14-21. AGM at Karachi on November 21. Ex-dividend date November 14.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
